{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crown Clash \u2013 Real-Time Multiplayer Card Strategy</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the fast-paced world of <strong>Crown Clash!</strong> Choose one of four unique cards to launch attacks, change the course of the match with <strong>Luck Cards</strong>, and outsmart your opponents with your wits. Think fast, plan your strategy, and with a bit of luck\u2014claim victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4145150/extras/53f3ef766980f0129c2a412ae116f335.poster.avif?t=1762590506\" width=600 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4145150/extras/53f3ef766980f0129c2a412ae116f335.webm?t=1762590506\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4145150/extras/53f3ef766980f0129c2a412ae116f335.mp4?t=1762590506\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose a card to strike your opponent\u2014but be careful! Every card has its own mana cost. Use your mana wisely, or your opponent might take you down first!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4145150/extras/205472fc6a53f737c663a556ccb1c442.poster.avif?t=1762590506\" width=600 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4145150/extras/205472fc6a53f737c663a556ccb1c442.webm?t=1762590506\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4145150/extras/205472fc6a53f737c663a556ccb1c442.mp4?t=1762590506\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t forget to attack the right card! Some cards are key to both your and your opponent\u2019s strategy\u2014so plan accordingly!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4145150/extras/8308ff6e2255e63aa086d1fc5142f678.poster.avif?t=1762590506\" width=600 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4145150/extras/8308ff6e2255e63aa086d1fc5142f678.webm?t=1762590506\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4145150/extras/8308ff6e2255e63aa086d1fc5142f678.mp4?t=1762590506\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anything from the <strong>Luck Box</strong> can completely change the course of the match. You never know what you\u2019ll get. <i>\u201cSay hello to my little friend!\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4145150/extras/897546e03cd535f90291dc2ffea6cef8.poster.avif?t=1762590506\" width=600 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4145150/extras/897546e03cd535f90291dc2ffea6cef8.webm?t=1762590506\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4145150/extras/897546e03cd535f90291dc2ffea6cef8.mp4?t=1762590506\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t forget to heal your damaged cards! Every attack happens in real time\u2014if you\u2019re not quick, you could lose your cards in an instant. That\u2019s why the Healer exists!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4145150/extras/6ffd28a0ee8ff4ba66005260e512bdf7.poster.avif?t=1762590506\" width=600 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4145150/extras/6ffd28a0ee8ff4ba66005260e512bdf7.webm?t=1762590506\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4145150/extras/6ffd28a0ee8ff4ba66005260e512bdf7.mp4?t=1762590506\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With your mana already limited, you might hesitate to level up your cards\u2014but dealing extra damage could change the entire game! Maybe it\u2019s not a smart move\u2026 or maybe it is. You\u2019ll never know until you try.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4145150/extras/976358d6ea0af55deda2698e71c57cee.poster.avif?t=1762590506\" width=600 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4145150/extras/976358d6ea0af55deda2698e71c57cee.webm?t=1762590506\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4145150/extras/976358d6ea0af55deda2698e71c57cee.mp4?t=1762590506\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, you\u2019ll be able to chat with your opponent\u2014or maybe not. We\u2019ll find out together once the game is released!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4145150/extras/07092322079496d91158c0a67e5873f4.poster.avif?t=1762590506\" width=600 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4145150/extras/07092322079496d91158c0a67e5873f4.webm?t=1762590506\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4145150/extras/07092322079496d91158c0a67e5873f4.mp4?t=1762590506\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal: destroy your opponent\u2019s <strong>tower</strong> or <strong>all their cards</strong> as fast as you can!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GOOD LUCK IN THE ARENA, SOLDIER!</strong> \ud83c\udfc6</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4145150?t=1762590506","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4145150/7225052ea7eacaf30616be04e7b0e30304f459f4/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762590506","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4145150/340092c7ee8580aebef4ee08e0551c7dbdc5281e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762590506","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4145150/340092c7ee8580aebef4ee08e0551c7dbdc5281e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762590506","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crown Clash \u2013 Real-Time Multiplayer Card Strategy</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the fast-paced world of <strong>Crown Clash!</strong> Choose one of four unique cards to launch attacks, change the course of the match with <strong>Luck Cards</strong>, and outsmart your opponents with your wits. Think fast, plan your strategy, and with a bit of luck\u2014claim victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4145150/extras/53f3ef766980f0129c2a412ae116f