aa086d1fc5142f678.mp4?t=1762590506\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anything from the <strong>Luck Box</strong> can completely change the course of the match. You never know what you\u2019ll get. <i>\u201cSay hello to my little friend!\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4145150/extras/897546e03cd535f90291dc2ffea6cef8.poster.avif?t=1762590506\" width=600 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4145150/extras/897546e03cd535f90291dc2ffea6cef8.webm?t=1762590506\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4145150/extras/897546e03cd535f90291dc2ffea6cef8.mp4?t=1762590506\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t forget to heal your damaged cards! Every attack happens in real time\u2014if you\u2019re not quick, you could lose your cards in an instant. That\u2019s why the Healer exists!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4145150/extras/6ffd28a0ee8ff4ba66005260e512bdf7.poster.avif?t=1762590506\" width=600 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4145150/extras/6ffd28a0ee8ff4ba66005260e512bdf7.webm?t=1762590506\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4145150/extras/6ffd28a0ee8ff4ba66005260e512bdf7.mp4?t=1762590506\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With your mana already limited, you might hesitate to level up your cards\u2014but dealing extra damage could change the entire game! Maybe it\u2019s not a smart move\u2026 or maybe it is. You\u2019ll never know until you try.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4145150/extras/976358d6ea0af55deda2698e71c57cee.poster.avif?t=1762590506\" width=600 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4145150/extras/976358d6ea0af55deda2698e71c57cee.webm?t=1762590506\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4145150/extras/976358d6ea0af55deda2698e71c57cee.mp4?t=1762590506\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, you\u2019ll be able to chat with your opponent\u2014or maybe not. We\u2019ll find out together once the game is released!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4145150/extras/07092322079496d91158c0a67e5873f4.poster.avif?t=1762590506\" width=600 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4145150/extras/07092322079496d91158c0a67e5873f4.webm?t=1762590506\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4145150/extras/07092322079496d91158c0a67e5873f4.mp4?t=1762590506\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal: destroy your opponent\u2019s <strong>tower</strong> or <strong>all their cards</strong> as fast as you can!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GOOD LUCK IN THE ARENA, SOLDIER!</strong> \ud83c\udfc6</p>","developers":["Fatih Eren Kalaman"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/41